Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what should I do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so troublesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,, Those people have nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch quietly. I'll finish this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Al, you're too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I thought you were human and underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it's really gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,NOOOOOOOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.13,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That certainly is a terrifying power you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.34,0:02:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
